  <main>
    <section class="hero hero-video"><video class="bgvid" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b?w=1600&q=60&auto=format&fit=crop"><source src="https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/15919/15919-720.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><div class="veil"></div>
      <div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="timeword"><span class="tw past">Past</span><span class="tw present">Present</span><span class="tw future">Future</span></div>
        <h1>A coach. Every day. <em>For your whole life.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Every morning you receive one key: a short teaching and one small practice. A Vault coach walks the year with you, chamber by chamber: learning from your past, loving your present, and living toward your future.</p>
        <div class="ctarow"><button class="btn btn-acc" type="button" data-vpop="/img/russ/v2/how-it-works.mp4" data-vpop-poster="/img/russ/v2/how-it-works-poster.jpg">Watch how it works</button><a class="btn btn-line" href="#" data-open-form>Begin with Vault</a></div>
        <p class="guarantee">From $99 a month. Your first week is on us.</p>
        
      </div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec gallery-sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="strip-head">Five ways to be coached</p><div class="gallery five"><figure><img src="/img/russ/strip/inperson.jpg" alt="Russ reading aloud to a group by a stone fireplace" style="object-position:50% 18%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>One on one</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/img/russ/strip/retreat.jpg" alt="A men’s circle gathered in a mountain meadow" style="object-position:50% 60%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>As a group</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1761839258657-457dda39b5cc?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A family of five standing together in a garden" style="object-position:50% 35%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>As a family</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542323228-002ac256e7b8?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Men and women on a team stacking their hands together" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>As a team</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1758518730136-1bf4fa26ccbf?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Business leaders talking around a conference table" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>As a business</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

    <section class="sec dark vid-sec" id="russ"><video class="bgvid" autoplay muted loop playsinline><source src="https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/47818/47818-720.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><div class="veil"></div><div class="wrap guide-grid">
      <img src="/russ-michaels.jpg" alt="Russ Michaels" width="340" height="425" loading="lazy" />
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Founder of Vault Human</p><h2>Russ Michaels</h2><p class="lede">Most coaches sell energy, a system, or a rule. Russ is a practicing attorney and a twenty-year operator who coaches from the whole picture: how you were built, how you are living, and what you intend to leave. Every key you receive was chosen and ordered by him, from a lifetime of learning from the world’s great teachers and traditions.</p><blockquote>Sometimes we meet life where it is, not where we are. We hold that together.</blockquote><div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/speaking/">About Russ</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/speaking/#book">Book Russ to speak</a></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec coach-sec" id="coaching"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">In the room</p><h2>The work happens face to face.</h2></div>
      <div class="lgrid home"><figure class="big"><video  style="--p:10% 50%;--pm:50% 35%" class="fg slow" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/img/russ/v2/home-room-poster.jpg" aria-label="Russ coaching a room from the stage"><source src="/img/russ/v2/home-room.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></figure><figure class=""><img  style="--p:100% 30%;--pm:100% 30%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/home-marianne.jpg" alt="Russ on stage with a microphone beside Marianne Williamson" width="1280" height="846" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure class=""><img  style="--p:50% 30%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/home-burchard.jpg" alt="Russ and Brendon Burchard at High Performance Academy" width="1200" height="869" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure class=""><img style="--p:50% 30%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/strip/friend.jpg" alt="Russ with Anthony Trucks" width="1200" height="961" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure class=""><img  style="--p:50% 40%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/home-forest.jpg" alt="A men’s circle gathered in a pine forest" width="1280" height="960" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure class=""><img  style="--p:50% 28%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/home-mic.jpg" alt="Russ speaking with a microphone on a lit stage" width="1035" height="1400" loading="lazy" /></figure></div>
    </div></section>
<style is:global>
  .lgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));grid-auto-rows:230px;gap:14px}
  .lgrid figure{margin:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px;background:#0d0f0d}
  .lgrid .big{grid-column:span 2;grid-row:span 2}
  .lgrid.tall .big{grid-column:span 1}
    .lgrid .fg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:var(--p,50% 50%)}
  @media(max-width:760px){.lgrid .fg{object-position:var(--pm,var(--p,50% 50%))}.lgrid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));grid-auto-rows:170px;gap:10px}.lgrid .big,.lgrid.tall .big{grid-column:span 2;grid-row:span 2}.lgrid:not(.tall) .big{grid-row:span 1}.lgrid:not(.tall) figure:last-child{grid-column:span 2}}
</style>
<script is:inline>document.querySelectorAll(".lgrid video.slow").forEach(function(v){v.playbackRate=0.5;v.addEventListener("loadedmetadata",function(){v.playbackRate=0.5;});});</script>

    <section class="sec alt" id="how"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>Three steps.</h2><p class="lede">Start free. Meet Russ. Then choose your plan.</p></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Start free</h3><p>Sign up for free access: a welcome letter and short video from Russ, the Vault Key in your inbox, and your first module. No card.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>Meet Russ</h3><p>Book a free 30-minute virtual conversation. It is part of your free assessment: no payment, no pitch, just where you are and where to start.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>Choose your plan</h3><p>Most people begin with the monthly membership: the year-long coaching modules in the Vault Human portal, plus a live monthly call led by Russ on that month’s chamber.</p></div></div>
      <div class="ctarow" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:28px"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#daily-key">Start free</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#" data-open-form>Book the free 30-minute call</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="parts"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Learn · Love · Live</p><h2>Three parts. One thread.</h2><p class="lede">Which part is loudest right now? Pick one. Your first key comes from there.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-rail"></div>
      <div class="tl-cards"><a class="tlc brown" href="/as-learned/"><div class="when">The past · Learn</div><h3>As Learned</h3><p>How you were wired. What you were taught. What still runs you.</p><span>Life as learned →</span></a><a class="tlc green" href="/as-loved/"><div class="when">The present · Love</div><h3>As Loved</h3><p>The life you're actually in. Being mindful is the work.</p><span>Life as loved →</span></a><a class="tlc navy" href="/as-lived/"><div class="when">The future · Live</div><h3>As Lived</h3><p>What you'll leave behind. Purpose, legacy, the plan.</p><span>Life as lived →</span></a><a class="tlc sage" href="/method/"><div class="when">Always · Listen</div><h3>As Listened</h3><p>How you hear yourself and others. The thread through all three.</p><span>Life as listened →</span></a></div>
      <p class="constant">One coach. One method. <a href="/plans/">One price to start.</a></p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="pricing"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Plans and pricing</p><h2>Simple to start.</h2></div>
      <div class="member"><div><p class="tag">Step one for everyone</p><h3>The Vault Keys membership</h3><p>A Vault Key every morning, the full coaching year in your Vault Human portal, and a live coaching call with Russ every month. Every way to be coached includes it.</p></div><div class="member-price"><div class="price">$99<small>/mo</small></div><p class="guarantee">Your first week is on us. Cancel any time.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Begin</a></div></div>
      <div class="plans"><div class="plan"><h3>One on one</h3><div class="price">$800<small>/mo</small></div><p>Two private 60-minute sessions a month with a Vault coach, plus messages between sessions.</p></div><div class="plan"><h3>As a group</h3><div class="price">$200<small>/person · mo</small></div><p>Groups of 5 to 10, meeting twice a month. Bring your own group or join one.</p></div><div class="plan"><h3>As a family</h3><div class="price price-word">Built for your family</div><p>On a sliding scale, by family size. Family sessions together and a check-in for each person. It starts with a free conversation.</p></div><div class="plan"><h3>As a team</h3><div class="price price-word">Built for your team</div><p>Priced by team size, goals and length. Most engagements run three to six months. It starts with a free conversation.</p></div><div class="plan"><h3>As a business</h3><div class="price price-word">Built for your organization</div><p>Leadership and team coaching, plus Vault Keys for your people at a volume rate. It starts with a free conversation.</p></div></div>
      <p class="offers-note">Every plan starts the same way: start free, then a free 30-minute call with Russ. Prices in US dollars, billed monthly.</p>
      <div class="ctarow" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:18px"><a class="btn btn-line" href="/plans/">See all plans</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="faq"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>Straight answers.</h2></div>
      <div class="faq"><details><summary>What is Vault Human?</summary><p>Vault Human is daily coaching for your whole life.</p></details><details><summary>How do I start?</summary><p>Start free. Book a free 30-minute call with Russ. Then choose your plan.</p></details><details><summary>What are keys, chambers and gates?</summary><p>Keys are the daily lessons. Chambers are the parts of your life. Gates open when a lesson becomes a habit.</p></details><details><summary>What are the 360 and the 180?</summary><p>The 360 are keys for the mind. The 180 are keys for the body. See <a href="/the-360/">the 360</a> and <a href="/the-180/">the 180</a>.</p></details><details><summary>Who coaches me?</summary><p>Russ Michaels is the founder of Vault Human. Our Vault coaches, Russ included, coach you.</p></details><details><summary>How much time does it take?</summary><p>Anything valuable takes time. We aim to complete the full picture of Vault Human in a year, at your pace, with a coach as your guide the whole way.</p></details><details><summary>Can my team or my family be coached?</summary><p>Yes. We coach teams, businesses and families. Each starts with a free conversation.</p></details><details><summary>Is this therapy?</summary><p>No. It's coaching. If a therapist or doctor would serve you better, we'll tell you and help you find one.</p></details><details><summary>What does the first week cost?</summary><p>Nothing. Your first week is on us.</p></details><details><summary>Can I cancel?</summary><p>Yes. Any time, with no fee.</p></details><details><summary>What are Fretwork, Triplicity and Tercet?</summary><p>Sister companies in the Vault Human family: <a href="https://www.fretworksystems.com">Fretwork Systems</a> (automation and AI for small teams), <a href="https://triplicityadvisory.com">Triplicity Advisory</a> (leadership and team coaching) and <a href="https://www.tercetlaw.com">Tercet Law</a> (wills, trusts and succession).</p></details></div>
    </div></section>

